The group generators for the conformal inhomogeneous spin gauge symmetry WS$_c$(1,3) in GSM are defined explicitly by the $\Gamma$-matrices as follows:
\be
& & \Sigma^{a b} = i [\Gamma^{a}, \Gamma^{b} ]/4 ,  \; \Sigma_{\mp}^{a}= \Gamma^{a} \Gamma_{\mp} , \; \Sigma_{\mp} = \pm i\gamma_9/2 , 
