All relevant gauge covariant field strengths, $\bshF_{cd}\equiv(\hF_{cd}^{(l_{\mp})}, \hF_{cd}^{(L_{\mp})}, \hF_{cd}^{(C)}, \hcW_{cd},  \hcF_{cd} , \hcF_{cd}^{(\mp)}, \hcF_{cd}^{W\mp})\equiv(\hF_{cd}\Sigma_{Y \mp}^{(l)} , \hF_{cd}^{i} \Sigma_{L\mp}^i, \hF_{cd}^{\alpha}T^{\alpha} , \hcW_{cd}, \hcF_{cd}^{ab}\Sigma^{ab}/2, \hcF_{cd} \Sigma_{\mp},\hcF_{cd}^{a}\Sigma_{\mp a})$, and $\bshcF_{cd}^{(W\mp)}$ in the action Eq.(\ref{GSMaction0}) are defined as follows:
