\title{Effects due to generation of negative frequencies during temporal diffraction}

\author{E. Hendry$^{1*}$, C. M. Hooper$^1$, W. P. Wardley$^1$, and S. A. R. Horsley$^1$
\\$^1$School of Physics and Astronomy, University of Exeter, Stocker Road, Exeter, EX4 4QL, UK
\\$^*$Corresponding author: e.hendry@exeter.ac.uk
