\end{flushleft}
\caption{A histogram showing the distribution of extinctions in the Keck merger sample. The extinction coefficient, $E_{(B-V)}$, is calculated from the MPA-JHU DR8 Catalog \citep{kauffmann+2003b,brinchmann+2004,tremonti+2004}. The grey bins corresponds to all targets in our sample, the blue hatched bins to the targets with no substructure and the crimson hatched bins to the targets with substructure. (see Section~\ref{sec4_1}).}
