Further spectroscopic analysis of the targets containing substructure is needed to confirm the presence of dual AGN in this sample. Follow-up OH-Suppressing Infrared Imaging Spectrograph (OSIRIS) K-band Integral Field Spectroscopy (IFS) observations of a subset of the sample will be presented by McDonald et al. (in preparation). 
