    \caption{Diagram showing the EAF's experiment groups along with ACORN and CMS notebook offerings. Each experiment group is accompanied by a brief description of what is included in the notebooks. AL refers to Alma Linux, and the number indicates the version (e.g., AL9 refers to Alma Linux 9).}
    \label{notebook-diagram}
