\paragraph{Learning dynamics}
"Learning" to generate is generically characterized by the bifurcations of two-parameter families (\cref{subsubsection:two-parameter-families-gradients}). An illustration of the training and generation dynamics of the above model as a two-parameter family is given in \colorAutoref{fig:figure-training-generation-diffusion}.



